{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "%@ is already another file; not overwriting it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已经是别的文件，不覆盖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@://": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld s": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pf step failed and will be retried next round; rules may still be loaded even while off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有 pf 动作没做成，下一轮重做；关着时规则也可能还在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plugin is a folder containing manifest.json; you can also drag one onto this page to install it. Pip never runs any file in a plugin. Uninstalled plugins move to ~/Library/Application Support/Notchkeeper/backup/plugins/ and aren’t deleted (except the built-in terminal plugin).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件是一个含 manifest.json 的文件夹，也可以直接拖到这一页上安装。Pip 不运行插件里的任何文件；卸掉的插件挪进 ~/Library/Application Support/Notchkeeper/backup/plugins/，不会删除（自带的终端插件除外）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plugin with the same id is installed: the old version moves to the backup folder and isn’t deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已经装着同 id 的插件：旧版挪进备份，不会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plugin with this id is already installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同 id 的插件已经装着"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alert card when traffic bypasses the proxy; egress shown at top of panel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有流量没走代理时弹红卡，面板顶上显示出口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alert cards are suppressed, and Pip and the panel will not show egress; background checks continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不弹红卡，Pip 和面板也不显示出口；后台照常检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alert when a command finishes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "命令跑完时弹卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts when a command that ran in zsh for over 10 seconds finishes; clicking the card switches back to that terminal. Suppressed when you are already looking at that terminal (other tabs or splits in the same window do not count). The command line reveals only the command name, without arguments; full-screen or interactive commands like vim, ssh, and top do not alert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zsh 里跑了 10 秒以上的命令结束时弹卡，点卡片跳回那个终端。你正看着那个终端时不弹（同一窗口的其他标签、分屏不算）。命令行只交出命令名，不带参数；vim、ssh、top 这类全屏或交互的命令不弹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All traffic is going through the proxy again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "流量又全部走代理了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed Egress IPs (IPv4)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许的出口 IP（IPv4）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always Closed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve in System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在系统设置中批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asleep": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "睡着"
          }
        }
      }
    },
