      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "危险"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes the terminal plugin’s script; the line in ~/.zshrc can stay without errors. Cards from the terminal will be dropped after this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删掉终端插件的脚本，~/.zshrc 里那一行留着也不报错。之后终端发来的卡片都会丢掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disabling a plugin only turns off its alerts; Egress Guard continues checking in the background. When an external plugin is disabled, cards and activities it sends are dropped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉插件只关提醒，出口守卫照常在后台检查。外部插件关掉后，它发来的卡片和活动都会丢掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dizzy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "晕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done: Glass - Error: Funk - Waiting: Ping - Bypassing proxy: Basso": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成 Glass · 出错 Funk · 等你 Ping · 有流量没走代理 Basso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Egress Guard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口守卫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Egress Guard is pinned to the top. All sections combined show up to %lld rows, allocated to earlier sections first; excess rows scroll within their section.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口守卫固定在最上面。各段合起来最多显示 %lld 行，排在前面的先占；多出来的在段里滚动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Egress Mismatch": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口不符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Egress OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口正常"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Egress recovered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口已恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable Plugin": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开插件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every visible Pip plays it once; with Reduce Motion on, only blinking. Nothing is written to disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看得见的 Pip 各播放一次；开启「减弱动态效果」时只有眨眼。不写入任何文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exit code %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出码 %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expand on Hover": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标悬停时展开"
          }
