        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装「%@」？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed, but disabled in Claude Code (enable with /plugin)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装，但在 Claude Code 里关掉了（/plugin 里打开）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed. It’s off and blocks nothing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装，现在是关着的，什么都不拦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed: add the line below to ~/.zshrc; takes effect in new terminals": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装：把下面这行加进 ~/.zshrc，新开的终端生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed: alerts when a turn finishes or errors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装：回合做完或出错时弹卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing needs an administrator password; the firewall starts off and blocks nothing. Enter Clash’s TUN interface name — utun followed by digits (Clash Verge defaults to utun1024): a wrong name blocks all internet traffic once the firewall is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装要管理员密码，装完是关着的，什么都不拦。隧道网卡填 Clash 的 TUN 网卡名，只收 utun 加数字（Clash Verge 默认 utun1024）：填错了开启后会把外网全拦掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs Pip’s bundled mod into Claude Code: records only how each turn finishes, never conversation contents. Installation adds a plugin entry to ~/.claude/settings.json, removed upon uninstallation. Open sessions must be restarted or run /reload-plugins to take effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给 Claude Code 装上 Pip 自带的 mod：只记录每个回合怎么结束，不记录对话内容。安装会在 ~/.claude/settings.json 里加一项插件，卸载时去掉。已经开着的会话要重开或运行 /reload-plugins 才生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internet traffic is routed outside Clash's tunnel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "去公网的路由没走 Clash 的隧道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被打断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s off after installing and blocks nothing; turn it on when you need it. Requires an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "装完是关着的，什么都不拦，要用时再打开。要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
