    "Linked: you can run pipctl directly in Terminal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已链接：终端里可以直接用 pipctl"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Links in cards and the panel open https by default. Schemes added here are also allowed: they can trigger actions in other apps, so add only ones you trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡片和面板里的链接默认只打开 https。这里加的 scheme 也放行：它们能让别的 App 执行动作，只加你信得过的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists sessions; alerts when finished, errored, or waiting for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列出会话；做完、出错、等你时弹卡"
