    "Test rules are installed: only traffic to the test address is blocked, which isn’t protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "装的是测试规则，只拦去测试地址的流量，不算保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That id belongs to a built-in plugin (guard, claude); choose another": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "id 是内置插件的（guard、claude），换一个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The alert card will dismiss, and Pip and the panel will no longer show the egress. Background checks continue, and turning it back on restores everything immediately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "红卡会撤下，Pip 和面板不再显示出口；后台照常检查，重新打开立即恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The config file can't be read, so settings can't be changed for now. They come back once the file is fixed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置文件读不了，暂时不能改设置。修好文件后自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The configuration file can’t be read; default values are shown instead of the file’s list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置文件读不了，这里显示的是默认值，不是文件里的列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The firewall state file can’t be read, so it’s treated as off; to turn it on again, uninstall and reinstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "防火墙状态文件读不出来，现在按关着办；要再开，先卸载再装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder has no manifest.json": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹里没有 manifest.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The id may only contain lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens, up to 32 characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "id 只能用小写字母、数字和连字符，至多 32 个字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plugin folder moves to the backup folder and isn’t deleted. Cards and activities it sends afterwards are discarded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件文件夹挪进备份，不会删除。之后它发来的卡片和活动都会丢掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules failed to load this round and will be retried; it may not be blocking right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则这一轮没装上，下一轮重做；现在可能没在拦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The status summary can’t be read": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "状态摘要读不出来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s no SF Symbol named %@ (look up names in the SF Symbols app)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统里没有叫 %@ 的 SF Symbol（名字可以在「SF Symbols」App 里查）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
