          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timed out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic is bypassing the proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有流量没走代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic is still bypassing the proxy. Turn off alerts anyway?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还有流量没走代理，确定关掉提醒？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Traffic that bypasses the Clash tunnel will be blocked, except for the local network, addresses Clash connects to directly, and mainland China IPs. It starts with a 2-minute trial: if you lose your connection, do nothing and it turns itself off; if all is well, click Keep. It reads the proxy nodes and China IP ranges from Clash Verge once when turned on; after changing subscriptions, turn it off and on again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没走 Clash 隧道的流量除局域网、Clash 直连的地址和国内 IP 外都会被拦下。先试运行 2 分钟：网断了什么都不用做，到时自动关掉；没问题就点「保留」。开启时从 Clash Verge 读一次节点和国内 IP 段，之后换了订阅要关掉再开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trial ended, turning off": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试运行到期，正在关掉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel Interface": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道网卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tunnel interface missing (Clash TUN is off, or the name is wrong): all internet traffic is blocked right now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道网卡不在（Clash 没开 TUN，或网卡名填错）：现在外网全被拦下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn 90°": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "侧身 90°"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off Alerts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the firewall?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
