      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出口 IP 不在允许列表里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall the firewall?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载防火墙？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall “%@”?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载「%@」？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstalled. Rules and files are removed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已卸载，规则和文件都清掉了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uninstall…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卸载…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to %lld rows": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Up to %lld row"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Up to %lld rows"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多 %lld 行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (signed locally)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本 %@（本机签名）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Victory Hop": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成跳转"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等你回答"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for Approval": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等你批准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the daemon to confirm…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等守护进程确认…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Retracted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收起时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, Pip is hidden from the left ear; if the right ear is also empty, the retracted notch is solid black. Shows normally when expanded or popping up cards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关掉后左耳不显示 Pip；右耳也没有内容时，刘海就是一块纯黑。展开和弹卡时照常显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When plugins are active or require attention, the retracted notch displays the most urgent one; when all are quiet, it displays the resident plugin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有插件在忙或要你看时，收起的刘海显示最急的那个；都平静时显示常驻插件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the list is empty, the guard cannot verify whether the egress IP is correct, showing “Can’t verify the egress”; traffic bypassing the proxy will still be alerted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列表为空时，守卫判断不了出口 IP 对不对，只能显示「暂时判断不了出口」；有流量没走代理仍然会报。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While on, traffic that bypasses the Clash tunnel is blocked, except for the local network, addresses Clash connects to directly, and mainland China IPs. Each time you turn it on, it runs a 2-minute trial and turns itself off unless you click Keep. Turning on, keeping, and turning off all need an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开着时，没走 Clash 隧道的流量除局域网、Clash 直连的地址和国内 IP 外一律拦下。每次开启先试运行 2 分钟，不点「保留」自动关掉。开启、保留、关闭都要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. 198.51.100.10": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 198.51.100.10"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "e.g. backup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 backup"
